## Voice & Microcopy (Tone rules)
- Be concise and helpful. Prefer clarity over cleverness.  
- Use active voice and present tense.  
- Use contractions sparingly for a friendly tone (e.g., "You’re set.").  
- When writing errors, describe what happened and how to fix it.

