## Example Microcopy (copy-paste ready)
**Buttons / CTAs**
- Primary CTA: `Deploy model`
- Secondary: `Cancel`, `Restart`, `Rotate API key`, `Upgrade plan`

**Success**
- `Deployment is live — your OpenAI-compatible endpoint is ready.`
- `API key copied to clipboard.`

**Informational / Status**
- `Provisioning: this usually takes 2–5 minutes.`
- `Auto-healing: investigating and restarting affected node.`

**Errors / Recovery**
- `Node crashed. We’re restarting it now — no action required.`
- `Deployment failed to start. Check logs or contact support.`

**Billing & Pricing**
- `You’ll be billed hourly when changing plans. Estimated charge: $X (prorated).`
- `No free trial — paid plans start immediately.`

**Empty states / Onboarding hints**
- `No deployments yet` (title) + `Get started by creating your first deployment` (description)
- `No members yet` (title) + `Invite team members to start collaborating` (description)  
- `No pending invitations` (title) + `Invitations you send will appear here` (description)

**Form & Input labels**
- `Organization Name` — Clear, concise field labels
- `Email` — Simple, obvious form fields
- `Action` — Button column headers in forms

**Tooltips / Security copy**
- On API key: `Keep this key secure and don't share it publicly`
- On copy buttons: `Copy to clipboard` (title attribute)
- On destructive actions: `return confirm('Remove member?')` — Clear confirmation prompts

